  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Great Vermintide" id="fb49-cf71-d602-5614" hidden="false">
      <description>If your Army Faction is **Skaven**, If a unit in this Army is at Half-Strength or below, subtract 1 from leadership tests and gain the following benefits:


• For friendly **Skaven** **Infantry**: This unit can&apos;t fail desparate escape checks and while making a fall back move you may add 1D6&quot; of movement to that units movement range. 


• For friendly **Skaven** **Monster** and **Beast** units: All Melee Weapons gain **Devastating Wounds**.


• For friendly **Skaven** **Vehicle** units: All Ranged Weapons gain **Lethal Hits**.

• For friendly **Skaven** **Mounted** units: While making a charge move add 1D6 to the roll and all Melee Weapons gain **Sustained Hits**.


If there is at least one **Character** unit within 3&quot; of that unit, leadership tests remain as normal unless that character unit is battleshocked.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
