                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the bearer is within the 3&quot; of a friendly non-CHARACTER SKAVEN INFANTRY unit:

• The bearer has Feel No Pain (4+).
• Each time you make a successful save roll with Feel No Pain for the bearer, allocate 1 mortal wound to a friendly non-CHARACTER SKAVEN INFANTRY unit within 3&quot; of the bearer&apos;s after the damage sequence for the bearer has been resolved.</characteristic>
