    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Detachment" hidden="false" id="f160-ba43-c94c-0645">
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachements" id="f2a3-c3ca-6279-e016" hidden="false">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Envoys of the Deepengnaw" hidden="false" id="3f53-45c1-f66f-373f" sortIndex="2">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="062f-afca-c94e-e24c" includeChildSelections="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Will of the Horned Rat" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="cc6d-2770-1418-f690">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly SKAVEN DAEMON is within the 3&quot; of a friendly non-CHARACTER SKAVEN INFANTRY unit:

• That SKAVEN DAEMON has Feel No Pain (4+).

• Each time you make a successful Feel No Pain roll for that SKAVEN DAEMON, allocate 1 mortal damage on a friendly non-CHARACTER SKAVEN INFANTRY unit within 3&quot; of that unit after the damage sequence for that unit has been resolved.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Claw-horde" hidden="false" id="206c-039c-3817-5e49" sortIndex="1">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="2f5a-8f02-3788-96ee" includeChildSelections="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Claw-picked" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="0384-6205-4152-0a80">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once Per Turn, Your Fight Phase. Pick up to 3 SKAVEN VERMINUS units that charged this turn to be the targets. Add 2 to the Armour Penetration and Strengh characteristic of the targets&apos; melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Fleshmeld Menagerie" hidden="false" id="a645-8c1f-e237-3b9b" sortIndex="3">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="cf4d-6e4d-097c-00da" includeChildSelections="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Prized Creations" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="ee20-7443-a37c-08b6">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once Per Turn, Your Command Phase. Pick up to 3 friendly non-CHARACTER SKAVEN MOULDER units to be the targets. Roll a dice for each target and apply the corresponding effect:

• 1-2 Self-destructive Fury: Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.

• 3-4 Rabid Infusion: Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target’s melee weapons until the start of your next turn.

• 5-6 Blinded by Frenzy: In addition to the effect of ‘Rabid Infusion’, the target has Feel No Pain (5+) until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Gathering of the Clans" hidden="false" id="e8f0-b869-edf7-6b7e" sortIndex="4">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="8d72-3534-5bf7-291c" includeChildSelections="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Backstabbing Allies" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="cd7b-582e-4765-bceb">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once Per Turn. You declared the ‘Scatter-Move!’ stratagem for a friendly SKAVEN unit. Pick up to 2 other friendly SKAVEN units that are not in combat and are wholly within 13&quot; of the unit using the ‘Scatter-Move!’ stratagem to be the targets. Each target must have at least one of the following keywords: VERMINUS, SKRYRE, MOULDER, PESTILENS, ESHIN. After that ‘Scatter-Move!’ stratagem has been resolved, each of the targets can immediately use the ‘Scatter-Move!’ stratagem in an order of your choice without any command points being spent.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Virulent Procession" hidden="false" id="ff50-b788-dc80-1269" sortIndex="5">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="6605-168c-0693-072b" includeChildSelections="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Corrupted Earth" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="41ee-133f-27cb-cbc2">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once Per Turn, End of Any Turn. Pick up to 3 friendly PESTILENS units that are in combat to be the targets. For each target:


• Make a pile-in move.


• Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with the target and roll D3 damage.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Warpcog Convocation" hidden="false" id="7661-cf6f-c466-213b" sortIndex="6">
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="d2d0-00dc-4056-c12d" includeChildSelections="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Skryre Prototypes" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="3902-b112-cb34-4074">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once Per Turn, Your Shooting Phase. Pick up to 3 friendly SKRYRE units to be the targets. Roll a dice for each target and apply the corresponding effect:


• 1 **Kaboom!**: Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.


• 2-5 **More Power!**: Add 1 to wound rolls for the target’s shooting attacks for the rest of the turn.


• 6 **Warpstone Overcharge**: In addition to the effect of ‘More Power!’, add 1 to the Armour Penetration characteristic of the target’s ranged weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="b932-c164-ee86-04f4" includeChildSelections="false"/>
            <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="ff3e-5303-b43b-5a91" includeChildSelections="false"/>
          </constraints>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
