          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent&apos;s shooting phase you may roll one D6: on a 1-2, this PSYKER&apos;s unit suffers D3 Mortal Wounds. On a 3+: until the end of the phase, models in this PSKER&apos;s unit have a 4+ Invulernable Save.</characteristic>
