        <profile name="More-More Warp Energy!" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="234f-e4e5-d6b8-5a36">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">On your shooting phase if this model has not moved this turn you may roll one D6. On a 2+ this model&apos;s **Warplock Musket** and **Warplock Musket - Overcharged** gains Anti-Monster 3+, and Anti-Vehicle 3+, and **Blast**. On a 1, inflict D3 Mortal Wounds to this unit.</characteristic>
