        <profile name="Artificial Tremors " typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="33b1-7eb9-cfe0-846d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your fight phase this unit can choose to use this ability instead of making an attack. An area of 12&quot; centered on a point within 3&quot; of this unit becomes unstable, all units in that area have their movement characteristic halved and need to roll a D6, on 3+ that unit becomes Disrupted. Disrupted units suffer a -1 penalty to their hit rolls and can&apos;t charge in their next charge phase. **Monster** and **Vehicle** units have their movement characteristic lowered by 3&quot; instead and are Distrupted on 5+ instead while Characters attached to this unit, **Warp-Grinder**, **Heavy Warp-Drill**, **Fly** and **Titanic** Units are not effected by this ability.
This ability can&apos;t lower a units movement below 3&quot;.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
