        <profile name="Pack Leader" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="4425-d32b-15c9-1959">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this unit is attached to a unit with **Beast** Keyword, said unit gains additional 2&quot; of movement, +2 to its charge rolls and may make consolidation moves up to 6&quot;.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mutated Mount" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="e471-5a33-3173-d34e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If this unit is leading a unit with **Beast** or **Monster** Keyword, remove this units **Infantry** Keyword and add **Mounted** Keywod Instead. Its movement range changes to be the same as that of its bodyguard unit,. If the attached unit dies, its movement range goes back to defult and this unit gains its **Infantry** Keywrod back.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Pack Master" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="f3f7-77f0-64a1-1225">
          <characteristics>
