      <profiles>
        <profile name="Mutagenic Protection" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="7d5b-45ff-6ac1-fd09">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly **Moulder** unit is within 13&quot; of this unit, they may reroll their Save rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Horrid Mutator" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="3173-a600-bb6b-c8fe">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per Battle Round after dealing at least 1 wound to an enemy roll a D6, on a 4+ the enemy mutates. If an enemy unit mutates roll a D6 to determine that units mutation:
1 - Swift Reflexes: All models in that unit gain +2 to their Movement Characteristic.
2 - Thick Skin: All models in that unit gain +1 to their Toughness Characteristic and -2 to their Movement Characteristic.
3 - Fragile Body: All damage dealt to this unit deals an additional 1 point of damage.
4 - Swolen Eyes: All attacks made by this unit suffer a -1 penalty to hit.
5 - Horrific Disfigurment: If an enemy unit starts its Command Phase within 3&quot; of this unit, it must make a battleshock test.
6 - Bountiful Mutations: Roll 2 more times and apply 2 new mutations. If a 6 is rolled again, you pick a mutation for that roll instead.
One unit can&apos;t be mutated more than once per combat. If a unit is destroyed and resurrected, all previouse mutations are removed and a new one can be applied if the conditions are met.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Verminlord Warpgnaw" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="2982-6985-71ca-7d8a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10&quot;</characteristic>
